---
title: Async Webhook Processing Pipeline
---
flowchart LR
    Shopify([Shopify\nWebhook]) --> Receiver

    subgraph Receiver["Receiver Layer"]
        R[FastAPI\nWebhook Receiver]
    end

    Receiver --> EventStore[(Event Store\nPostgreSQL\ndurable)]
    EventStore --> Queue

    subgraph Queue["Queue Layer"]
        Q[Redis Streams\nMessage Queue]
        DLQ[(Dead Letter\nQueue)]
    end

    Queue --> Workers

    subgraph Workers["Worker Layer"]
        W1[Order Worker]
        W2[Inventory Worker]
        W3[Fulfillment Worker]
        W4[Catalog Worker]
    end

    W1 --> ERP[ERP]
    W2 --> WMS[WMS]
    W3 --> ThreePL[3PL]
    W4 --> Marketplace[Marketplace]

    Workers --> Observability

    subgraph Observability["Observability Layer"]
        Metrics[Prometheus\nMetrics]
        Logs[Structured\nJSON Logs]
    end

    Q -->|exhausted retries| DLQ
    DLQ --> ReplayEndpoint[Replay Endpoint\nadmin-only]
    ReplayEndpoint -->|re-enqueue| Q

    note["Each layer has a single responsibility.\nThe receiver never calls external systems.\nWorkers never know about Shopify's delivery model."]
